#: custom.php:62 custom.php:62
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To ensure the optimal user experience at all screen sizes, please <a "
"href=\"%s\">update your site settings</a> so that the value of <em>Results "
"Per Page (Public)</em> is a number divisible by both 2 and 3 (for example, "
"12 or 18)."
